<p> M2					    +3.02		+9.83</p>
<p> Broad money				 +3.33	     +10.44</p>
<p> Lev-denominated broad money	   +6.36	     +10.83</p>
<p> Dollar-denominated broad money	+1.45	     +10.19</p>
<p> Individuals' savings deposits	 +2.19		+2.19</p>
<p> Individuals' dollar deposits	  +1.62		+8.28</p>
<p> Individuals' term deposits	    +1.73		+2.60</p>
<p> Company term deposits		   +0.30		+7.42</p>
